There are no magic markers. These tools were added later on in more recent
versions of NetHack.
Blank scrolls are useless in 1.0.3. The only thing you can do with them is
to sell them in a shop and get some credit. The reason why there are blank
scrolls in NetHack 1.0.3. is that sometimes scrolls get wiped out (when you
fall into water while having teleport-at-will ability), so they needed to
have blank scrolls in the game.
